<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>迪尔预计 2027 年农民将面临阻力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/deere-sees-headwinds-ahead-for-farmers-in-2027-video</link><description>迪尔公司表示，预计截至 10 月份的 12 个月内，其最大机器的销量将会增加，但净利润也将达到 45 亿至 52.5 亿美元，低于彭博社编制的分析师平均预期 61 亿美元。克里斯·西奥利诺 (Chris Ciolino) 有关“彭博未平仓合约”的更多内容。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/deere-sees-headwinds-ahead-for-farmers-in-2027-video'&gt;迪尔预计 2027 年农民将面临阻力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Deere Sees Headwinds Ahead for Farmers in 2027&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/deere-sees-headwinds-ahead-for-farmers-in-2027-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:46:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能交易陷入困境，纳斯达克 100 指数将进入熊市</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nasdaq-100-set-for-bear-market-as-ai-trade-unravels-at-the-seams</link><description>由于投资者在情绪迅速恶化的情况下抛售与人工智能行业相关的股票，纳斯达克 100 指数将陷入一年多以来的首次熊市。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nasdaq-100-set-for-bear-market-as-ai-trade-unravels-at-the-seams'&gt;人工智能交易陷入困境，纳斯达克 100 指数将进入熊市&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Set for Bear Market as AI Trade Unravels at the Seams&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nasdaq-100-set-for-bear-market-as-ai-trade-unravels-at-the-seams</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:50:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</link><description>BC Partners 的信贷部门已同意购买 GSE Worldwide 的多数股权，GSE Worldwide 是一家体育营销机构，代表高尔夫名人布赖森·德尚博 (Bryson DeChambeau) 和前 NFL 和 MLB 球星博·杰克逊 (Bo Jackson) 等运动员。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list'&gt;BC Partners 收购 GSE 体育经纪公司，高尔夫球手德尚博也在其中&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BC Partners Buys GSE Agency With Golfer DeChambeau on List&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/bc-partners-buys-gse-sport-agency-with-golfer-dechambeau-on-list</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>房屋建筑商股票在经历 2008 年以来最长的暴跌后仍将持续困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008</link><description>房屋建筑商即将迎来一个不祥的市场里程碑，该集团的股价将连续三年下跌，这是自次贷危机导致全球金融危机以来最长的一次下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008'&gt;房屋建筑商股票在经历 2008 年以来最长的暴跌后仍将持续困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Homebuilder Stock Woes to Persist After Longest Slump Since 2008&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/homebuilder-stock-woes-to-persist-after-longest-slump-since-2008</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:01:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Enters Bear Market Territory as AI Angst Fuels Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>